:: Bailey Orphan Gossip [widget]
<<widget "baileyOrphanGossip">>
	<<if $syndromebaileybuild gte 1 and !$weekly.baileyOrphanGossip>>
		<<set $bailey_gossip_seen to ($bailey_gossip_seen || {})>>
		<<set _pick to "">>

		/* One-shot: <<if CONDITION and !$bailey_gossip_seen.KEY>><<run _once.push("KEY")>><</if>> */
		<<set _once to []>>
		<<if $stockholm_points and $stockholm_points.cafe and !$bailey_gossip_seen.cafe>><<run _once.push("cafe")>><</if>>

		<<if _once.length gt 0>>
			<<set _pick to _once[random(0, _once.length - 1)]>>
			<<set $bailey_gossip_seen[_pick] to true>>
		<<else>>
			/* Repeatable: <<if CONDITION>><<run _pool.push("KEY")>><</if>> */
			<<set _pool to []>>
			<<if $bailey_date_allnight gte 1>><<run _pool.push("allnight")>><</if>>
			<<if $bailey_title_unlocked and $bailey_title isnot "Bailey">><<run _pool.push("title")>><</if>>
			<<if $bailey_desk_offered gte 1>><<run _pool.push("desk")>><</if>>
			<<if $worn.neck.name is "Bailey's collar">><<run _pool.push("collar")>><</if>>
			<<if $baileydefeated gt 1>><<run _pool.push("defeated")>><</if>>
			<<if $baileydefeatedlewd gt 1>><<run _pool.push("defeatedlewd")>><</if>>
			<<if $bailey_date_short gte 1>><<run _pool.push("snitch")>><</if>>
			<<if $bailey_offered gt 1>><<run _pool.push("offered")>><</if>>
			<<if $syndromebailey>><<run _pool.push("generic")>><</if>>

			<<if _pool.length gt 0>>
				<<set _pick to _pool[random(0, _pool.length - 1)]>>
			<</if>>
		<</if>>

		<<if _pick isnot "">>
			<<set $weekly.baileyOrphanGossip to true>>
			You see a group of orphans whispering amongst themselves and sneaking glances at you.
			<br><br>
			<<switch _pick>>
				<<case "cafe">>
					"Did you hear?" One of the orphans murmurs, loud enough for you to listen in. "At the Cafe opening, <<pshe>> actually lied that the orphanage is a great place and that Bailey takes care of us."<<hope -1>><<lhope>>
				<<case "allnight">>
					One of the orphans whispers, "I saw Bailey drive <<phim>> to the orphanage early in the morning<<if $bailey_date_allnight gte 2 or $bailey_monogamous>> many times!"<<else>>."<</if>>
				<<case "title">>
					"I heard <<phim>> call Bailey <<baileyTitle>>," says one of the orphans. Another orphan <<print either("gasps", "looks surprised")>>.
				<<case "desk">>
					"Whenever <<pshe>> goes into Bailey's office, <<pshe>> locks the door and stays in there way too long," murmurs one of the orphans. Another orphan <<print either("giggles", "scoffs")>>.
				<<case "collar">>
					"<<pShes>> wearing that collar with the lotus on it again," whispers one of the orphans. "There's something weird going on between <<phim>> and Bailey, I swear..."
				<<case "defeated">>
					"<<pShe>> beat Bailey up! I saw it!" says one of the orphans, a bit too enthusiastically. Another orphan in the crowd looks <<print either("inspired", "hopeful")>>.<<hope 1>><<ghope>><<reb 1>><<greb>>
				<<case "defeatedlewd">>
					"<<pShe>> made Bailey cum in <<nnpc_his "Bailey">> trousers! No, really! I saw it!" laughs one of the orphans. Another orphan in the crowd <<print either("snickers", "giggles")>>.<<hope 1>><<ghope>><<reb 1>><<greb>>
				<<case "snitch">>
					"Whatever you do, don't talk to <<phim>>," whispers one of the orphans, pointing at you without shame. "<<print either("<<pShes>> in cahoots with Bailey.", "<<pShe>>'ll snitch on you to Bailey.")>>"<<reb -1>><<lreb>>
				<<case "offered">>
					"<<pShes>> a freak. I saw <<phim>> pay Bailey rent and then offer <<pherself>> to be sold anyway," murmurs one of the orphans, pointing right at you. Another orphan looks at you with <<print either("confusion", "pity")>>.<<hope -1>><<lhope>>
				<<case "generic">>
					"<<pShe>> is always <<print either("hanging around", "looking at")>> Bailey," says one of the orphans. "<<print either("What a suck up.", "Looks like Bailey's got a pet.")>>"<<hope -1>><<lhope>>
			<</switch>>
			<br><br>
			One of the orphans makes eye contact with you and looks away. They moved on to gossiping about someone else.
			<br><br>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>


